<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Expected_result">Expected result</span></h2>
<ul><li>The sensor needs to preheat for about a minute to heat the internal sensitive materials of the sensor.</li>
<li>Put the sensor inside the device containing sensitive gas, and the indicator on the module lights up. The indicator goes off when the sensor is removed from the device.</li></ul>
<p>The examples provided are based on the STM32F103RBT6 and the STM32H743, the connection provided is based on the STM32F103RB. <br />
